{'symbol': 'TJX', 'date': '2022-08-29 20:10:00', 'title': 'BETTERINVESTING™ MAGAZINE UPDATE ON TJX COMPANIES AND THE BOEING COMPANY', 'text': 'TROY, MICH. , AUG. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE EDITORIAL ADVISORY AND SECURITIES REVIEW COMMITTEE OF BETTERINVESTING MAGAZINE TODAY ANNOUNCED TJX COMPANIES INC.\xa0(NYSE: TJX) AS ITS "STOCK TO STUDY" AND THE BOEING COMPANY (NYSE: BA) AS ITS "UNDERVALUED STOCK" IN THE NOVEMBER 2022 ISSUE FOR INVESTORS\' INFORMATIONAL AND EDUCATIONAL USE.'}